    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "An FIR was lodged alleging that one Sunil Chourasiya who impersonated himself as Secretary of Sarvoday Grah Nirman Sahakari Sanstha/Society and sold Plot No.38 to Prashant Mevati and also executed the registry in favour of one Prashant Mevati and the present applicant was one of the witnesses of the registry and applicant is also one of the witnesses in the agreement between Dinesh Kumar Bairagi, Bharat Prajapati and Prashant Mevati.",
