    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2024:MPHC-IND:26728 2 MCRC-36130-2024 There is another complainant Amreen Sheikh who has stated that her Plot No.12 situated in Sarvoday Grah Nirman Colony, Dewas was purchased by her from co-accused Shakir Beg, and Sunil Chourasiya and paid Rupees 12,00,000/- to them out of 23,24,000/- but later on she came to know that Shakir Beg and Sunil Chourasiya are not the members of Sarvoday Grah Nirman Colony, Dewas and they have no concern with the society.",
