        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23307837545871735
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "In the connected bail application filed by co-accused, a PUD has been received from the trial court in which it is stated that out of 20 prosecution witnesses, 16 have already been examined and the prayer for extension was sought on the ground there are number of accused persons and the defense has to lead evidence.",
