      "start": 2582,
      "end": 2899,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28673309087753296
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "This court has already passed an order today granting further six months time to conclude the trial on the PUD of the trial court in connected case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2900,
      "end": 3048,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16278599202632904
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "6. Learned counsel for the respondent/state points out that in the court statement of the witnesses till now have made specific allegations against the NEUTRAL CITATION NO.\n2024:MPHC-IND:26728 3 MCRC-36130-2024 applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3050,
      "end": 3271,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "NEUTRAL CITATION NO.",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3202,
          "end": 3223
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08746986091136932
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The allegation against the applicant is serious in nature as he has impersonated himself as Dinesh Kumar Bairagi and signed the documents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3272,
      "end": 3410,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Dinesh Kumar Bairagi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3364,
          "end": 3384
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37404751777648926
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "He was a witness of the registry and documents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3411,
      "end": 3458,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4924510419368744
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "7. Since the application of the applicant has already been rejected on merits and there are serious allegations, this court does not find any ground for grant of bail merely on the ground that he has been detained in jail for one year and six months.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3460,
      "end": 3710,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40183019638061523
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The judgment passed in the case of Moh. Muslim (supra) was related to the NDPS Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PRE_RELIED",
      "start": 3711,
      "end": 3794,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Moh. Muslim",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
